== Limits and next step

Primary texts were not read for King, EGO, Knudsen, Kuhn–Struik, Nagao or Menezes–Qu, because
the fetches were blocked. The entries rest on abstracts or secondary sources, as stated.
No claim about any deployed curve is made.

Next: apply `references_proposed.md` to §18, and apply the wording fixes listed in
`RESULTS.md` § "Next step".
